{"ref":"BDB, שָׁגַג","hw":"שָׁגַג","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁגַג</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. go astray, commit sin</strong> or <strong>error (</strong>‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁגה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוג</span><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁגָג֛</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.18\">Lv 5:18</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁגֵג</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:16\" href=\"/Job.12.16\">Jb 12:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:67\" href=\"/Psalms.119.67\">ψ 119:67</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁגֶ֫גֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:28\" href=\"/Numbers.15.28\">Nu 15:28</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>error</em>, mentally <a data-ref=\"Job 12:16\" href=\"/Job.12.16\">Jb 12:16</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>sin</em> ignorantly, inadvertently, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.18\">Lv 5:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:28\" href=\"/Numbers.15.28\">Nu 15:28</a> (P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:67\" href=\"/Psalms.119.67\">ψ 119:67</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשַׁגָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:3\" href=\"/Genesis.6.3\">Gn 6:3</a> perhaps Inf. cstr. sf., <em>by reason of their going astray</em>, v. Ges<sup>§ 67 p</sup> Ew Dr al.; > Vrss <em>for that he also</em> is flesh. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִישַׁג</span>, v. p. 4b.","next":"BDB, שְׁגָגָה","prev":"BDB, שָׁגֵא"}